  "body": "Released: 2026-09-09\n\n### Changed\n\n- The seven in-repo SDKs now use `agent-history-v2`, with schema version 1.\n  The generic `localOnly` status property is removed. CLI status and setup JSON\n  use schema version 3; generic usage/error, index and daemon envelopes use\n  schema version 2. Update consumers that require the old field or check these\n  versions; the [migration guide](https://github.com/ctxrs/ctx/blob/1dc6d684c62ccfdb86ee1733e69144a824a745f4/contracts/agent-history-v2/README.md#migrating-from-v1)\n  covers the affected APIs. Operation-specific Semantic diagnostics retain\n  their execution-location information.\n\n### Fixed\n\n- Semantic search shows and cites the passage that earned the result's score.\n- Semantic document chunks no longer lose their final tokens to tokenizer\n  truncation.\n- Codex imports preserve distinct item and tool-call identities when both are\n  present in a transcript.\n- Failed index rebuilds clean up their abandoned candidate files. Disk-pressure\n  reports use the observed free space.\n\nGitHub downloads contain unmanaged Core-only binaries. The\n[hosted installer](https://ctx.rs/install) installs the managed Core and Pro pair.\nExisting managed installations move through the 1.3.2 bridge before 1.4.0.\nWindows 0.25.0 users must stop any opted-in legacy ctx daemon and rerun the\n[PowerShell installer](https://ctx.rs/install.ps1).\n\n### Commits and PRs\n\n- Source commit: [1dc6d684](https://github.com/ctxrs/ctx/commit/1dc6d684c62ccfdb86ee1733e69144a824a745f4).\n- Full diff: [v1.3.2...1dc6d684](https://github.com/ctxrs/ctx/compare/v1.3.2...1dc6d684c62ccfdb86ee1733e69144a824a745f4).\n- Merged PRs: [#959](https://github.com/ctxrs/ctx/pull/959),\n  [#960](https://github.com/ctxrs/ctx/pull/960).\n- Direct commits: [a16a8023](https://github.com/ctxrs/ctx/commit/a16a8023dd172ecd88003241bb49c5789a247067),\n  [2ba1b48f](https://github.com/ctxrs/ctx/commit/2ba1b48fb4b17bfe34d8b174038df80606ff34b6),\n  [d5fd46e4](https://github.com/ctxrs/ctx/commit/d5fd46e41e896f4221af793975053dc8c115b1f3),\n  [1595b89e](https://github.com/ctxrs/ctx/commit/1595b89e3de8aed0e76d8901e54a3ddfaee36f4a), and\n  [1e199c7e](https://github.com/ctxrs/ctx/commit/1e199c7e95960f48af4d5dbb02f2d259a5aea26c).\n"
}
